<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roofer-work.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roofer-work-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roofer-work.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">Services</li></ol></nav><p class="kicker">What we do</p><h1>Insurance Appraisal Services for Washington Property Claims</h1><p class="lede">From a single estimate review to full panel representation and neutral umpire work, every Washington Insurance Appraiser service is built around an accurate, defensible valuation of your loss.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-y" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line light" href="/talk-to-an-appraiser/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="cards3" data-stagger><a class="pcard rv" href="/insurance-appraisal-services/appraisal-demand-representation/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation-table.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-table-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation-table.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Service 01</span><h2 class="pcard-t">Appraisal Clause Representation</h2><span class="pcard-p">We act as the appraiser you name once either side demands appraisal under your policy.</span><span class="pcard-more">Learn more <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/insurance-appraisal-services/home-insurance-claim-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/home-evergreens.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/home-evergreens-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/home-evergreens.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Service 02</span><h2 class="pcard-t">Homeowner Claim Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-p">Single-family houses, townhomes and condo units where the carrier’s estimate misses real repair costs.</span><span class="pcard-more">Learn more <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/insurance-appraisal-services/condo-hoa-commercial-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/condo-building.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/condo-building-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/condo-building.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Service 03</span><h2 class="pcard-t">Condo, HOA &amp; Commercial Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-p">Master-policy, multifamily, retail, office and industrial losses with large scopes and long timelines.</span><span class="pcard-more">Learn more <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/insurance-appraisal-services/roof-hail-damage-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-damage.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Service 04</span><h2 class="pcard-t">Roof &amp; Hail Damage Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-p">Shingle, metal, tile and low-slope roof disputes over slopes, repairability, steep charges and code items.</span><span class="pcard-more">Learn more <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/insurance-appraisal-services/windstorm-tornado-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-sky.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-sky-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-sky.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Service 05</span><h2 class="pcard-t">Windstorm &amp; Tornado Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-p">Pacific windstorms, bomb cyclones and the occasional tornado: torn roofs, siding, fences and outbuildings.</span><span class="pcard-more">Learn more <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/insurance-appraisal-services/tree-impact-claim-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/fallen-tree-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fallen-tree-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fallen-tree-house.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Service 06</span><h2 class="pcard-t">Fallen Tree Damage Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-p">Douglas fir, cedar and maple impacts on roofs, framing and decks, plus removal and crane costs.</span><span class="pcard-more">Learn more <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/insurance-appraisal-services/water-rain-intrusion-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/water-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/water-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/water-damage.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Service 07</span><h2 class="pcard-t">Water &amp; Rain Intrusion Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-p">Burst pipes, supply-line failures and wind-driven rain, valued with moisture mapping and full drying scopes.</span><span class="pcard-more">Learn more <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/insurance-appraisal-services/house-fire-smoke-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Service 08</span><h2 class="pcard-t">Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-p">Structure fires, smoke and soot cleaning, odor control and contents losses priced room by room.</span><span class="pcard-more">Learn more <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/insurance-appraisal-services/wildfire-ash-claim-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-smoke.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-smoke-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wildfire-smoke.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Service 09</span><h2 class="pcard-t">Wildfire &amp; Ash Claim Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-p">Total losses, partial burns and smoke and ash contamination from Washington wildfires.</span><span class="pcard-more">Learn more <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/insurance-appraisal-services/snow-ice-freeze-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snow-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snow-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snow-house.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Service 10</span><h2 class="pcard-t">Snow, Ice Dam &amp; Freeze Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-p">Roof collapse, ice dams, frozen pipes and ice-storm damage from Washington’s winter weather.</span><span class="pcard-more">Learn more <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/insurance-appraisal-services/carrier-estimate-review/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-paperwork.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-paperwork-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-paperwork.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Service 11</span><h2 class="pcard-t">Carrier Estimate Review</h2><span class="pcard-p">A line-by-line review of the insurer’s estimate before you decide whether to supplement or demand appraisal.</span><span class="pcard-more">Learn more <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/insurance-appraisal-services/neutral-umpire-services/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/paperwork-review.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/paperwork-review-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/paperwork-review.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Service 12</span><h2 class="pcard-t">Neutral Umpire Services</h2><span class="pcard-p">Impartial umpire for appraisal panels when the two appraisers can’t agree on the amount of loss.</span><span class="pcard-more">Learn more <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap faq-grid"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Not sure where to start?</p><h2>Most claims begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know where the insurer’s estimate falls short and what the gap is worth. A review gives you that answer in days, and many disputes close at that stage.</p><a class="btn btn-g" href="/insurance-appraisal-services/carrier-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for just one part of the process?<svg class="ico chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Many clients start with an estimate review and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle both homes and commercial buildings?<svg class="ico chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes: houses, condos, multifamily, retail, office, industrial, farm buildings, churches and HOA properties.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle hurricane claims?<svg class="ico chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Washington doesn’t get hurricanes. Our storm work focuses on the Pacific windstorms, wildfires, ice and water events that cause most losses here.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-strip"><div class="wrap cta-strip-in rv"><div><h2>Have a claim that doesn’t add up?</h2><p>Send us the insurer’s estimate. We’ll review it and tell you what we see.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-y" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line light" href="/talk-to-an-appraiser/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
